# Acme agent context boundary. Files here are hidden from Cursor's Agent, Tab,
# Inline Edit and @-mentions. Best-effort only: the agent's terminal and MCP
# tools can still read them. The hard boundaries are the CI checks.

# Third-party code kept as-is (boundaries rule: never edit vendored code)
src/_skimage2/_vendored/

# Secrets and credentials (synthesized Acme policy; none exist in this repo)
.env
.env.*
*.pem
*.key
**/secrets/
